# Local Worker configuration only. No setup codes, private keys, or JWTs belong here.
# keyring (default): require an available OS credential store.
# auto: prefer the OS store and allow a protected-file fallback for new/legacy state.
# file: explicitly choose permissions-protected, unencrypted private-key storage.
# RADIUM_WORKER_CREDENTIAL_STORE="keyring"

# State location is a CLI option: --state-dir PATH.
# See packages/worker/README.md for saved-backend behavior and headless setup.
